    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tuning it",
      "text": [
        "Sneak-use a Ley Lens on the collector to print the exact breakdown, factor by factor. The number it prints is the beat, not Pulse a second. Ley sight draws the lines that pass near you, so you can stand on one before you build.",
        "When the beat is **8 or more** (half of 16), each collection also wakes every totem within 8 blocks and keeps it answered. Only the beat matters here; how full the collector is does not. See [Keeping](keeping).",
        "A redstone signal pauses it. Each [rank](machine_ranks) adds **15%** to every collection.",
        "If it seems weak, crouch and right-click it with this book."
      ]
    },
